This phy driver is binded with the Rockchip DisplayPort
driver, here are the brief properties:
	edp_phy: edp-phy@ff770274 {
		compatible = "rockchip,rk3288-dp-phy";
		rockchip,grf = <&grf>;
		clocks = <&cru SCLK_EDP_24M>;
		clock-names = "24m";
		#phy-cells = <0>;
	};

